{"tool_name":"template-matching-and-slice-alignment----imagej-plugins","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>This&nbsp;<a href=\"http://imagej.nih.gov/ij/\">ImageJ</a>&nbsp;plugin contains two functions. The first one is the&nbsp;<em>cvMatch_Template</em>. It implements the template matching function from the&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fopencv.willowgarage.com%2Fwiki%2FWelcome&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFrqEzcCNHnJ0fdYSuCF8-zkEDPTmXHM6Q\">OpenCV</a>&nbsp;library. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>The second function<em>&nbsp;Align_slices in stack</em>&nbsp;utilized the previous matching function to do slice registration(alignment) based on a selected landmark.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>For more details, refer to the page of each component.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"http://biii.eu/cvmatchtemplate\">cvMatch_Template</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"http://biii.eu/align-slices-stack\">Align Slices in Stack</a></p>","summary":"","value":"<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>This&nbsp;<a href=\"http://imagej.nih.gov/ij/\">ImageJ</a>&nbsp;plugin contains two functions. The first one is the&nbsp;<em>cvMatch_Template</em>. It implements the template matching function from the&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fopencv.willowgarage.com%2Fwiki%2FWelcome&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFrqEzcCNHnJ0fdYSuCF8-zkEDPTmXHM6Q\">OpenCV</a>&nbsp;library. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>The second function<em>&nbsp;Align_slices in stack</em>&nbsp;utilized the previous matching function to do slice registration(alignment) based on a selected landmark.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more details, refer to the page of each component.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"http://biii.eu/cvmatchtemplate\">cvMatch_Template</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"http://biii.eu/align-slices-stack\">Align Slices in Stack</a></p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-05-09T02:08:58+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-05-07T17:01:19+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/qingzongtseng/template-matching-ij-plugin#credit\">https://sites.google.com/site/qingzongtseng/template-matching-ij-plugin\u2026</a>","value":"https://sites.google.com/site/qingzongtseng/template-matching-ij-plugin#credit"}],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1525712787,"last_comment_uid":94,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Qingzong TSENG "}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[{"target_id":4055,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image_registration","url":"/image-registration"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6077b127-35d6-45a8-ac32-b321e9bd18f2","url":"/taxonomy/term/4340"}],"has_interaction_level":[{"target_id":3573,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"43cf6a59-36ad-49c8-9baa-3c5494481f13","url":"/taxonomy/term/3573"}],"has_license":[],"has_location":[{"options":[],"title":"Plugin website","uri":"https://sites.google.com/site/qingzongtseng/template-matching-ij-plugin"}],"has_programming_language":[{"target_id":3591,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"4f81e1f6-97a6-4c0c-8376-69202b8e2d36","url":"/taxonomy/term/3591"}],"has_reference_publication":[],"has_usage_example":[],"image":[{"alt":"","height":200,"target_id":331,"target_type":"file","target_uuid":"419